OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by car threatened with
OL,4,Astabbing, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was fatally injured after a
OL,7,Fcar drove into a crowd had told a
OL,8,Ffriend someone threatened to stab him
OL,9,Foutside a bar minutes earlier.
OL,11,FTyler Fairman died in hospital on 12
OL,12,FMay, three days after the 26-year-old
OL,13,Fwas hit by a car on Gedling Road in
OL,14,FArnold, Nottinghamshire.
OL,16,FConor Croft, a fellow player at
OL,17,FWoodthorpe Park Rangers Football Club,
OL,18,Ftold a jury at Nottingham Crown Court
OL,19,Fhis teammate said a stranger had
OL,20,Fthreatened him during an altercation
OL,21,Fthat evening.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
